cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use vanderfast in published work, please cite it as below, together
  with the DFT-D3 and DFT-D4 papers listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
type: software
title: "vanderfast: GPU DFT-D3(BJ) and DFT-D4 dispersion energies, forces, and stress"
abstract: >-
  CUDA implementation of the DFT-D3(BJ) and DFT-D4 dispersion corrections,
  including the Axilrod-Teller-Muto three-body term and the EEQ charge model,
  for molecules and periodic systems, with a NumPy API and ASE calculators.
authors:
  - family-names: Slocombe
    given-names: Louie
    email: louies@hotmail.co.uk
version: 1.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/LouieSlocombe/vanderfast
url: https://github.com/LouieSlocombe/vanderfast
keywords:
  - dispersion correction
  - DFT-D3
  - DFT-D4
  - EEQ
  - CUDA
  - ASE
  - molecular dynamics
